{
  "comment": "Spreadsheet headers scripts/roster.py recognizes, per field. A header is compared in lower case with everything but letters and digits removed, so 'First Name', 'first_name' and 'FIRST-NAME' are the same header. A password column is recognized only so that it can be reported and left out: no password is ever sent.",
